f7 cannot be defended} Qxe3 38. Qe7 Nh5 39. Qxf7+ Kh8 40. Qxg6 {[pgndiagram]
And White wins.}) 36. Nxd8 Nxc5 {Now Black is two clear pawns up, and the task
