38. Nxe5 Nxe5 39. Rxe5 Rxe5 40. Rxe5 Rxa4 41. Rg5) 34. d4 {[pgndiagram]
Carlsen choses the central breakthrough. It was doubted by the chess24
commentating duo, but there is nothing wrong with this move} (34. b4 {Was
possible of course} axb4 {There is nothing better though} (34... Nf7 35. bxa5
Ra8 36. exd5 exd5 37. Nd4 $1 {[pgndiagram] The key move} g6 38. Nb3 {And White
is in control})) 34... exd4 35. Nxd4 g6 36. Re3 {[pgndiagram] Preparing the
